BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (started offering refills for their own products. There are also general packaging reuse) Tj T* (services that work with many kinds of products. What makes us different is that we focus only) Tj T* (on candles and on small makers, and we include a data dashboard so that customers can see their) Tj T* (impact. We believe a focused service is easier for small makers to use than a general one.) Tj T* (Large brands run their own programs and are not likely to serve small makers. We think our) Tj T* (biggest competition is really customers doing nothing, because returning a jar takes effort and) Tj T* (many people will not bother.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (Maya Lindqvist is a junior studying environmental science and leads operations and) Tj T* (partnerships. She has experience running a campus recycling drive. Derrick Okonkwo-Hale is a) Tj T* (senior studying industrial design and leads the physical product, including the mailer and the) Tj T* (cleaning process. Priya Venkataraman is a junior studying information systems and builds the) Tj T* (dashboard and handles the data. We are all students at our university and work on this) Tj T* (alongside our classes. We have not yet added any advisors, but we plan to look for mentors with) Tj T* (experience in consumer products and logistics.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Milestones and Financials) Tj T* () Tj T* (So far we have defined our core business concept, built a prototype, and gotten our first) Tj T* (external users. Our prototype includes a basic mailer design, a simple cleaning process we) Tj T* (developed in a shared kitchen space, and a first version of the dashboard. We have had a small) Tj T* (number of friends, family and a few local candle makers try the program, and early feedback has) Tj T* (been positive. People said the idea was interesting and that they liked seeing the dashboard.) Tj T* (We have not yet formed a legal entity and we do not have a website. We have not generated) Tj T* (meaningful revenue. Our spending so far has been small and paid by the founders. In the next) Tj T* (year we hope to form a company, sign up several more candle makers, process a few thousand) Tj T* (jars, and begin charging fees. We expect to reach break-even once we have enough partners, but) Tj T* (we have not built a detailed financial model yet.) Tj T* () Tj T* (What We Are Asking For) Tj T* () Tj T* (We are asking for prize funding from the competition to help us take the next steps. We would) Tj T* (use the money to form a legal entity, build a simple website, buy a larger supply of mailers) Tj T* (and cleaning equipment, and run a pilot with more candle makers. We would also like to receive) Tj T* (mentorship and introductions to people in sustainable consumer products, shipping and small) Tj T* (business. Finally, feedback from the judges would help us improve our plan and decide on our) Tj T* (pricing. We believe Wickedgood Candle Return can make reuse easy for candle lovers and help) Tj T* (small makers be more sustainable, and this competition would help us get started.) Tj ET
endstream
